      <div type="article" xml:id="PressMint-GB_1898-02-11_WidnesExaminer_art0086" n="art0086">
        <head>IMPORTANT TO YOU.</head>
        <p>IMPORTANT TO YOU.</p>
        <p>When a man has suffered for years with a weakness that blights his life and robs him of all his pleasures • when, after years of doctoring with all sorts Of patent medicines. he finds at 'rat the right treatment, which brings back to him the power and energy that seemed lost for ever, that man should have every reason to be thankful. A MEDICAL TREATISE (96 Pages) on this seientific and most successfal method for the rapid and permanent cure of Nervous Debility and the kindred physical and ervous ailments, also on Diseases of the Skin, Bladder, Blood, and Urinary System may be obtained by post, in envelope, on receipt of 4 Stamps, by writing to clay to Mugu. WILKINSON AND CO., 3 AND 4, FITZ ALAN-SQUARE, SHEFFIELD. Every married and single men should avail himself of 1 the opportunity to secure a copy of this valuable book, which thoroughly explains the different ailments arising from business worry and their rapid and permanent cure. BY POST, SEALED.</p>
